  concept: "Authored objective: Repair feedback and certify.\nAuthored requirement:
    Recorded from the electrical graph, valid calibrated feedback and the level\u2019s
    verified run history. voltage \u2265 4.8 V. voltage \u2264 5.2 V.\nGeneral teaching
    principle: A feedback controller compares measured behavior with a reference
    and acts subject to plant dynamics and limits.\nOnly fresh, authoritative game
    evidence can establish that this objective is complete."
  analogy: Steering toward a target works only if the feedback accurately describes
    where you are.
